<title>USA: ARCO Chemical names Fernandes as chairman.</title>
<headline>ARCO Chemical names Fernandes as chairman.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTOWN SQUARE, Pa. 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>ARCO Chemical Co said on Wednesday that Executive Vice President Anthony Fernandes had been elected as chairman of its board of directors.</p>
<p>Fernandes, an ARCO Chemical board member since 1996, replaces Mike Bowlin, chairman and chief executive of ARCO.</p>
<p>In a statement, ARCO Chemical said Fernandes, 52, has responsibility for all of its downstream operations, including ARCO Products Co and ARCO Global Energy Ventures.</p>
<p>ARCO Chemical Co manufactures propylene oxide and derivatives, and other intermediate chemicals.</p>
